 is green."}},{"id":397,"category":"animals","en":"Peacock","hi":"मोर","mr":"मोर","mr_roman":"mor","example":{"mr":"मोर नाचतो.","roman":"Mor nachto.","en":"The peacock dances."}},{"id":398,"category":"animals","en":"Frog","hi":"मेंढक","mr":"बेडूक","mr_roman":"beduk","example":{"mr":"बेडूक उडी मारतो.","roman":"Beduk udi marto.","en":"The frog jumps."}},{"id":399,"category":"animals","en":"Lizard","hi":"छिपकली","mr":"पाल","mr_roman":"paal","example":{"mr":"भिंतीवर पाल आहे.","roman":"Bhintivar paal aahe.","en":"There is a lizard on the wall."}},{"id":400,"category":"animals","en":"Cockroach","hi":"तिलचट्टा","mr":"झुरळ","mr_roman":"jhural","example":{"mr":"स्वयंपाकघरात झुरळ आहे.","roman":"Swayampakgharat jhural aahe.","en":"There is a cockroach in the kitchen."}},{"id":401,"category":"animals","en":"Butterfly","hi":"तितली","mr":"फुलपाखरू","mr_roman":"phulpakharu","example":{"mr":"फुलपाखरू रंगीत आहे.","roman":"Phulpakharu rangit aahe.","en":"The butterfly is colourful."}},{"id":402,"category":"animals","en":"Sheep","hi":"भेड़","mr":"मेंढी","mr_roman":"mendhi","example":{"mr":"मेंढीची लोकर मऊ असते.","roman":"Mendhichi lokar mau aste.","en":"Sheep's wool is soft."}},{"id":403,"category":"animals","en":"Bullock / Ox","hi":"बैल","mr":"बैल","mr_roman":"bail","example":{"mr":"बैल शेत नांगरतो.","roman":"Bail shet nangarto.","en":"The ox ploughs the field."}},{"id":404,"category":"animals","en":"Deer","hi":"हिरण","mr":"हरीण","mr_roman":"harin","example":{"mr":"हरीण वेगाने पळतं.","roman":"Harin vegane palta.","en":"The deer runs fast."}},{"id":674,"category":"animals","en":"Rabbit","hi":"खरगोश","mr":"ससा","mr_roman":"sasa","example":{"mr":"ससा गाजर खातो.","roman":"Sasa gajar khato.","en":"The rabbit eats a carrot."}},{"id":675,"category":"animals","en":"Camel","hi":"ऊँट","mr":"उंट","mr_roman":"unt","example":{"mr":"उंट वाळवंटात चालतो.","roman":"Unt valavantat chalato.","en":"The camel walks in the desert."}},{"id":676,"category":"animals","en":"Donkey","hi":"गधा","mr":"गाढव","mr_